\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\f0\fs40\lang9 Coalition Theory of Everything in the Universe\par

\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\tx180\fs28 1. Singularites do not exist in nature, they are just artifacts of flawed mathematical assumptions. They violate the principles of Finite Physical Quantities, Causality, Conservation, Continuity of the Medium, Finite Compressibility, Determinism, and Physical Realism.\par
2. Infinity mass density is impossible to achieve in nature.\par
3. Black holes are not what GR predicts they are. \par
4. Spacetime is a made up construct used by Einstein to simlify the field equations so he could solve the complex mathematics he didn't fully understand. The concept warps the coordinate systems of space and time which has to remain consitant to develop the theory of everything. \par
5. Time dialtion is not real, measured frequency change due to motion and gravitational effects in differnt reference frames are real and predictable. Our coalition model based on a Newtonian reference frame interprets the data differently than Einstein's spacetime model. The equivalency principles baked into Einstein's models were applied outside of their accepted domain; just like a the constant light speed c in a vacuum, have been applied in regions that do not meet the vacuum conditions and thus need to be reevaluated. \par
6. The equivalency principle applies to forces and acceleartion but not to frequency. This is where Einstein's model diverged and assumed that the measured frequency changes were due to time dialtion instead of Doppler effect for relative velocity differences between the 2 observers. Also, when accelerations are considered this adds complexity to the analysis beyond the difference in velocity. If two obsevers ar accelerating at diffent rates we have to account for the differences in acceleration and the additional Doppler shift. \par
7. Light speed is only constant in a vacuum. This implies near zero temperature and pressure to attain it's maximum speed c. When light or other  electromagnetic waves travel thru regions of space that are not a vaccum the speed of light and other EM waves is slowed down. This has been experimentally verified. Near black holes and stars or even planets and sometimes moons there can be a significant increase in the surrounding material contributing to heating and plasma. These regions of space have a significant medium where the pressure is not close to a vaccum, These regions slow down the speed of light as we will show in our theory and calculations.  Einstein's models do not account for this so the age of the matter in the universe can be much older than we curently believe. Around Kerr black holes, the extreme temperatures, pressures, and magnetic compression drive hydrogen into a state where it behaves as a fluid, metal\f1\_\f0 like plasma. This and extreme gravity within the event horizon are why why the light cannot esca\par
8. Trinca Postulate: The acceleration of the expansion of matter in the universe may be caused by a rotating universal mass which causes centrifugal force overcoming centripetal force of gravity, while at the same time an expanding mass lowers the centripetal force of gravity especially as we move away from the center of mass of the universe. An alternative cause could be that we are not accurately modleing with spacetime, and thus the conclusion that the universe is expanding is falable due to the assumptioins and manipulation of data by modles that incorporate Einstein's Theory of Relatvity and Special Relativity. If the matter within the universe is expanding due to the Big Bang; then the initial explosion was large enough to overcome gravity and as the matter envolope expanded gravity had less and less of a chance of reversing this expansion. Recent observations from space telescopes have shown multiple examples where Einstein's Theory breaks down. Coalition Theory uses a completely different approach; that allows a deeper look into areas of the universe that are not accessible thru Einstein's lense. Our coalition model concurs with Einstein's predictions where Einstein's model is valid; and contunes to provide detailed information in regions where Einstein's model breaks down or has no solution. By constructing a coordinate system that maintains geometry as a 3d-spatial system with (x, y, z) coordinates and a seperate indpendant time coordinate (t) where all quantites or positions in the set (x, y, z, t) or the sets (x, y, z) and (t) are between -\f2\u8734?\f0\lang9  and + \f2\u8734?\f0\lang9\par
9. The rate of change of time is constant throughout the universe. That means dt/dt=1 everywhere always, this assumption prohibits time travel in its purest sense and explains that time travel is not possible in our real universe. Since no time travel has ever been documented or experienced this seems perfectly plausible.  \par
